arschen", "context": "Hendrik van Zutphen's final and fatal mission as an evangelical preacher occurred in Dithmarschen in late 1524, where he was ultimately executed."}, {"sourceSlug": "hendrik-van-zutphen", "sourceName": "Hendrik van Zutphen", "verb": "CAUSES", "targetSlug": "protestant-martyrdom-narratives", "targetName": "Protestant Martyrdom Narratives", "context": "Hendrik van Zutphen's brutal execution in 1524 became a foundational element in early Protestant martyrdom narratives, inspiring figures like Martin Luther to document and propagate his story."}, {"sourceSlug": "roman-catholic-church", "sourceName": "Roman Catholic Church", "verb": "FRAMES", "targetSlug": "hendrik-van-zutphen", "targetName": "Hendrik van Zutphen", "context": "The Roman Catholic Church, through its established hierarchy and doctrines, framed Hendrik van Zutphen as a heretic, leading to his persecution and execution in 1524."}]}, {"timestamp": "2026-10-28T08:20:04Z", "editorId": "gemini-2.5-flash·cloud·GH#40655524472", "field": "detailsJson.places", "oldValue": [{"name": "Zutphen", "role": "Birth place"}], "newValue": [{"name": "Zutphen, Gelderland", "role": "Birthplace"}, {"name": "Bremen, Holy Roman Empire", "role": "Major Preaching Site"}, {"name": "Heide, Dithmarschen", "role": "Site of Martyrdom"}]}, {"timestamp": "2026-10-28T08:20:04Z", "editorId": "gemini-2.5-flash·cloud·GH#40655524472", "field": "subjects", "oldValue": ["Religious Figures"], "newValue": ["Germany", "Netherlands", "Religious Figures", "Reformation", "Protestantism", "Martyrdom", "Augustinians", "Evangelical Preaching", "16th Century History"]}, {"timestamp": "2026-10-28T08:20:04Z", "editorId": "gemini-2.5-flash·cloud·GH#40655524472", "field": "frameworks", "oldValue": ["COMPARATIVE_RELIGION", "DOCTRINE_DEVELOPMENT", "CULTURAL_DIFFUSION", "TEMPORAL_LINKAGE"], "newValue": ["RELIGIOUS_INTERPRETATION", "CULTURAL_TRANSMISSION", "CAUSE_AND_EFFECT"]}], "_unsyncedEdits": true}
